WEBVTT

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:36.950 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:39.950 line:0%
[Episode 17]

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.279 line:0%
Just observe and listen.

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:43.880 line:0%
Don't cause any trouble.

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:45.480 line:0%
Or you'll be charged with

00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:47.559 line:0%
disrupting the trial.

00:01:49.660 --> 00:01:51.660 line:0%
Your words are quite intimidating.

00:01:52.089 --> 00:01:53.670 line:0%
However, let's not forget,

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:54.440 line:0%
no matter how low

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:56.839 line:0%
Ji Fangming's position in the Ministry of Justice is,

00:01:56.839 --> 00:01:58.080 line:0%
he's still an official

00:01:58.080 --> 00:01:59.670 line:0%
appointed by the imperial court.

00:01:59.670 --> 00:02:02.310 line:0%
If you attempt to extract a false confession out of him,

00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:04.780 line:0%
I certainly won't stand by and do nothing.

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:14.440 line:0%
Ji Fangming.

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:16.670 line:0%
No matter how many elusive techniques there are,

00:02:16.670 --> 00:02:18.530 line:0%
they are ultimately just tricks.

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:20.420 line:0%
What's fake is fake.

00:02:20.580 --> 00:02:22.310 line:0%
It's ultimately not the truth.

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:25.150 line:0%
You've been scheming for so many years,

00:02:25.320 --> 00:02:26.600 line:0%
all because you wanted to know

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:28.080 line:0%
the truth about what happened at Jinxiu Workshop back then,

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:28.920 line:0%
right?

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:30.160 line:0%
What a pity.

00:02:30.430 --> 00:02:32.560 line:0%
You ended up killing the wrong person,

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:34.740 line:0%
seeking revenge on the wrong target,

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:38.000 line:0%
and getting used by others without even realizing it.

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:41.250 line:0%
Save your breath, Miss Yan.

00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:43.320 line:0%
Trying to trick a criminal into confessing,

00:02:43.320 --> 00:02:44.120 line:0%
this tactic

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:45.960 line:0%
is hardly new.

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:48.440 line:0%
Since you all want to know,

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:51.400 line:0%
I'll tell you the truth.

00:02:55.290 --> 00:02:57.550 line:0%
Chen Shoujie and his wife, Mrs. Chen,

00:02:57.680 --> 00:02:59.600 line:0%
were the instigators back then.

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:00.480 line:0%
Everything that's happened recently

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:01.920 line:0%
was all done by me alone.

00:03:02.350 --> 00:03:03.520 line:0%
It was all for avenging

00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:05.600 line:0%
the dozen or so people who were wrongfully killed

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:07.000 line:0%
at Jinxiu Workshop.

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:08.360 line:0%
Why are you so certain

00:03:08.940 --> 00:03:10.080 line:0%
that what you know

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:11.520 line:0%
is the whole truth?

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:13.360 line:0%
Mrs. Chen was originally

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:15.120 line:0%
an embroiderer at Jinxiu Workshop, too.

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:16.780 line:0%
To cover for her,

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:18.120 line:0%
Chen Shoujie took advantage of the case investigation

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:19.360 line:0%
to erase her background

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:21.600 line:0%
and arbitrarily alter others' testimonies.

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:22.400 line:0%
Back then,

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:24.810 line:0%
before Kong Xianrong sent the summer clothes design

00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:26.440 line:0%
to Princess Runing's mansion for handover,

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:27.970 line:0%
he personally reviewed it.

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:29.200 line:0%
It was only after he took it

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:30.620 line:0%
to verify with the embroiderers that the design was sealed.

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:31.420 line:0%
Therefore,

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:32.720 line:0%
it could only have been switched

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:34.040 line:0%
during the interaction

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:35.290 line:0%
with the embroiderers.

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:36.480 line:0%
After the incident,

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:38.440 line:0%
everyone from Jinxiu Workshop

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:39.760 line:0%
was detained and interrogated,

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:41.260 line:0%
except for Mrs. Chen,

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:43.310 line:0%
who slipped through the net.

00:03:43.770 --> 00:03:45.840 line:0%
After I found out about this,

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:48.120 line:0%
I went to probe Chen Shoujie.

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:50.040 line:0%
Shoujie.

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:53.520 line:0%
Do you remember this?

00:03:52.970 --> 00:03:54.720 line:0%
[Jinxiu Workshop]

00:03:56.580 --> 00:03:56.740 line:0%
[Jinxiu Workshop]

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:00.710 line:0%
Jinxiu Workshop.

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:06.080 line:0%
No.

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:07.000 line:0%
It can't be brought up.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:08.060 line:0%
Or I can't survive.

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:11.440 line:0%
I was wrong.

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:12.500 line:0%
We were wrong.

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:13.850 line:0%
We don't know anything.

00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:15.240 line:0%
Every grievance has its perpetrator, and every debt has its debtor.

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:16.000 line:0%
Please don't

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:17.310 line:0%
come to us for revenge!

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:18.480 line:0%
Honey!

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:19.740 line:0%
Don't say anything.

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:21.319 line:0%
Just because of this,

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:23.140 line:0%
you were convinced that

00:04:23.140 --> 00:04:24.870 line:0%
Chen Shoujie was the murderer?

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:27.040 line:0%
Do you know why those people

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:29.040 line:0%
are so afraid of these illusions?

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:31.240 line:0%
It's because they know

00:04:31.240 --> 00:04:33.240 line:0%
many people from Jinxiu Workshop died unjustly,

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:35.320 line:0%
and they fear their vengeful ghosts will come for revenge!

00:04:35.320 --> 00:04:36.480 line:0%
Deep down,

00:04:36.709 --> 00:04:37.709 line:0%
they feel guilty!

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:43.880 line:0%
There are no ghosts or spirits in this world.

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:46.420 line:0%
If there are really ghosts in this world,

00:04:46.420 --> 00:04:48.290 line:0%
they only exist in people's hearts.

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:50.020 line:0%
If you have a clear conscience,

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:51.920 line:0%
why fear those ghosts

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:53.050 line:0%
coming to your door?

00:04:53.209 --> 00:04:55.160 line:0%
Lord Shen, you are indeed upright.

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:56.959 line:0%
But not everyone

00:04:56.959 --> 00:04:59.080 line:0%
is like what you said.

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:01.090 line:0%
For some people,

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:03.160 line:0%
even if they've done something wrong,

00:05:03.160 --> 00:05:04.120 line:0%
they'll put on a facade

00:05:04.120 --> 00:05:05.080 line:0%
of being a good person

00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:06.610 line:0%
and blend in with the crowd,

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:09.260 line:0%
making it difficult for us

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:12.120 line:0%
to distinguish them from good people.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:13.340 line:0%
So,

00:05:14.240 --> 00:05:15.440 line:0%
you killed Mrs. Chen?

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:16.240 line:0%
That's right!

00:05:16.470 --> 00:05:17.600 line:0%
She deserved to die!

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:19.360 line:0%
She was the mastermind!

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:20.440 line:0%
She was the culprit

00:05:20.990 --> 00:05:23.270 line:0%
who switched the summer clothes

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:24.290 line:0%
design.

00:05:30.940 --> 00:05:32.330 line:0%
Jinxiu Workshop.

00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:34.240 line:0%
I knew you'd come.

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:36.060 line:0%
Do you have any last words?

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:37.560 line:0%
It's time to pay the price.

00:05:40.959 --> 00:05:42.090 line:0%
I killed her

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:43.840 line:0%
only to console

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:45.600 line:0%
my brother's spirit in heaven.

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:47.370 line:0%
What's wrong with that?

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:50.170 line:0%
Even for those who have committed unforgivable crimes,

00:05:50.170 --> 00:05:52.500 line:0%
it's up to the imperial law to punish them.

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:54.160 line:0%
If you have grievances, you can seek justice

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:55.290 line:0%
and appeal the case.

00:05:55.320 --> 00:05:56.560 line:0%
But taking the law into your own hands and committing murder

00:05:56.560 --> 00:05:57.520 line:0%
is simply wrong.

00:05:57.760 --> 00:05:59.220 line:0%
That's easy for you to say.

00:05:59.490 --> 00:06:00.480 line:0%
Seek justice?

00:06:00.970 --> 00:06:01.940 line:0%
Appeal the case?

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:03.820 line:0%
So many years have passed.

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:06.240 line:0%
Who doesn't know that the Jinxiu Workshop case was a miscarriage of justice?

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:07.120 line:0%
But who

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:09.780 line:0%
has been willing to stand up and speak the truth?

00:06:11.540 --> 00:06:12.800 line:0%
Not to mention others.

00:06:13.340 --> 00:06:14.870 line:0%
Just take you as an example.

00:06:15.010 --> 00:06:17.250 line:0%
You hold a high position,

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:19.480 line:0%
and you're deeply trusted by the Grand Empress Dowager,

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:20.560 line:0%
yet you've allowed this case

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:21.800 line:0%
to be buried for so many years

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:23.260 line:0%
without ever speaking up.

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:27.270 line:0%
Since that's the case,

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:29.320 line:0%
I might as well

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:30.800 line:0%
deal with them myself.

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:35.520 line:0%
So after you killed Mrs. Chen,

00:06:35.970 --> 00:06:37.080 line:0%
you deliberately left

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:39.100 line:0%
the traumatized and mentally unstable Chen Shoujie alive.

00:06:39.100 --> 00:06:41.630 line:0%
It wasn't out of consideration for old times' sake,

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:43.120 line:0%
but because you wanted to torment him while he's still alive,

00:06:43.120 --> 00:06:43.880 line:0%
right?

00:06:46.620 --> 00:06:47.590 line:0%
That's correct.

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:50.160 line:0%
Mrs. Chen was the main culprit.

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:51.650 line:0%
Surely she deserved to die.

00:06:51.650 --> 00:06:52.780 line:0%
As for Chen Shoujie,

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:54.660 line:0%
I didn't kill him

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:56.320 line:0%
not because I didn't want to.

00:06:57.160 --> 00:06:58.120 line:0%
He sheltered the murderer,

00:06:58.120 --> 00:06:59.080 line:0%
so he couldn't escape blame.

00:06:59.080 --> 00:06:59.920 line:0%
Killing him

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:02.600 line:0%
would have been too easy on him.

00:07:05.370 --> 00:07:06.900 line:0%
It suddenly occurred to me,

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:09.560 line:0%
why not use another method

00:07:09.560 --> 00:07:11.080 line:0%
to torture him to death?

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:12.480 line:0%
So that he could truly experience

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:13.520 line:0%
what it's like to be in a wrongful case,

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:15.040 line:0%
losing family and close friends,

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:15.920 line:0%
and experience the feeling of helplessness

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:17.830 line:0%
and despair!

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:20.550 line:0%
Xianrong.

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:23.160 line:0%
I've finally

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:24.760 line:0%
brought justice for you all.

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:26.550 line:0%
[Moths to a flame. Born at dawn, dead by dusk. Not entering the cycle of reincarnation. Immortal reincarnation.]

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:27.200 line:0%
Those people

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:28.760 line:0%
deserve to never

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:30.240 line:0%
be reincarnated!

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:32.910 line:0%
But now,

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:36.000 line:0%
he has gone mad,

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:37.260 line:0%
and yet you

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:38.280 line:0%
still choose to believe

00:07:38.280 --> 00:07:39.510 line:0%
that he is innocent!

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:41.240 line:0%
You just refuse to accept the fact

00:07:41.240 --> 00:07:43.200 line:0%
that the Jinxiu Workshop case was a miscarriage of justice!

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:43.920 line:0%
Therefore,

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:45.430 line:0%
you are also guilty!

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:47.000 line:0%
You

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:49.870 line:0%
should all pay the price for this!

00:07:53.430 --> 00:07:54.390 line:0%
What Huo'e?

00:07:54.770 --> 00:07:57.130 line:0%
Huo'e! Huo'e! Huo'e!

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:06.300 line:0%
[Mingsheng Temple]

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:20.360 line:0%
This was

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:22.220 line:0%
found at Chen Shoujie's mansion.

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:24.490 line:0%
It's fabric from Jinxiu Workshop.

00:08:24.840 --> 00:08:25.920 line:0%
If they really were

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:27.840 line:0%
the instigators as you said,

00:08:28.120 --> 00:08:29.000 line:0%
then why would they

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:30.690 line:0%
carefully preserve

00:08:30.720 --> 00:08:31.720 line:0%
something that constantly reminds them

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:33.080 line:0%
of their crimes?

00:08:36.219 --> 00:08:37.349 line:0%
This is impossible.

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:39.490 line:0%
Perhaps you're not the only one

00:08:40.170 --> 00:08:41.830 line:0%
who feels helpless and bitter

00:08:42.800 --> 00:08:44.530 line:0%
about what happened back then.

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:52.500 line:0%
I can't be wrong.

00:08:54.190 --> 00:08:55.870 line:0%
I absolutely cannot be wrong.

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:58.430 line:0%
Maybe you've just been so focused on revenge

00:08:58.430 --> 00:08:59.830 line:0%
that you failed to notice

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:03.110 line:0%
that what Mrs. Chen had been staring at until she died

00:09:03.110 --> 00:09:04.280 line:0%
was the hidden compartment in the beam

00:09:04.280 --> 00:09:05.880 line:0%
where the fabric was hidden.

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:08.200 line:0%
Perhaps she wanted to say something,

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:09.870 line:0%
but she never got the chance.

00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:25.020 line:0%
It was all my fault.

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:28.210 line:0%
It was all my fault.

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:30.640 line:0%
I shouldn't have kept the truth

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:32.080 line:0%
hidden for so many years.

00:09:33.020 --> 00:09:34.510 line:0%
I was afraid of dying.

00:09:34.650 --> 00:09:36.550 line:0%
To protect my family,

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:38.560 line:0%
I ended up harming so many people.

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:40.690 line:0%
I deserve to die.

00:09:44.400 --> 00:09:46.860 line:0%
In the end, there is no concealing the truth.

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:48.640 line:0%
The truth is about to be revealed

00:09:48.640 --> 00:09:50.240 line:0%
to the world.

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:51.860 line:0%
Kong.

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:53.680 line:0%
I've let you down.

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:56.120 line:0%
It was because of my cowardice

00:09:56.140 --> 00:09:57.460 line:0%
that I got coerced

00:09:57.490 --> 00:09:59.220 line:0%
into hastily closing the case.

00:10:00.020 --> 00:10:01.080 line:0%
I never thought...

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:04.110 line:0%
I never thought that...

00:10:04.990 --> 00:10:06.320 line:0%
You were coerced?

00:10:06.450 --> 00:10:07.720 line:0%
Who exactly coerced you?

00:10:07.720 --> 00:10:08.920 line:0%
Tell me!

00:10:13.650 --> 00:10:15.460 line:0%
What's the use of admitting your mistake now?

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:17.290 line:0%
So many people were wrongly accused and died.

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:18.030 line:0%
So many wronged souls

00:10:18.030 --> 00:10:19.560 line:0%
are unable to rest in peace.

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:20.960 line:0%
As a government official,

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:21.840 line:0%
you feared the real culprit

00:10:21.840 --> 00:10:23.200 line:0%
and covered up the truth.

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:24.440 line:0%
Even if you admit your mistake now,

00:10:24.440 --> 00:10:24.920 line:0%
can those people

00:10:24.920 --> 00:10:26.320 line:0%
be brought back to life?

00:10:26.840 --> 00:10:28.440 line:0%
Who exactly coerced you?

00:10:28.570 --> 00:10:30.880 line:0%
Huo'e! Huo'e! Huo'e!

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:33.440 line:0%
Chen Huo'e! Chen Huo'e! Chen Huo'e!

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:38.660 line:0%
Chen Huo'e! Chen Huo'e!

00:10:39.420 --> 00:10:40.680 line:0%
It's Chen Huo'e again.

00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:43.930 line:0%
No way.

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:45.760 line:0%
I couldn't have killed the wrong person.

00:10:45.760 --> 00:10:47.610 line:0%
Mrs. Chen was definitely the murderer.

00:10:47.610 --> 00:10:49.210 line:0%
She wouldn't have lied to me.

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:06.330 line:0%
So who instructed you

00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:08.720 line:0%
to lead Yan Xing to Mingsheng Temple?

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:11.420 line:0%
So I was really being used?

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:14.000 line:0%
I was really being used?

00:11:25.100 --> 00:11:26.570 line:0%
Everyone laughs

00:11:27.560 --> 00:11:29.490 line:0%
at the moths flying into the flame,

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:30.880 line:0%
but little do they know that

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:33.440 line:0%
mayflies live and die in a day,

00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:34.600 line:0%
not entering the cycle of reincarnation.

00:11:34.600 --> 00:11:36.280 line:0%
The moths endure the fire and do not die,

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:37.680 line:0%
being reincarnated in the cycle!

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:39.280 line:0%
Ji Fangming, wake up!

00:11:41.530 --> 00:11:45.020 line:0%
Kong Xianrong proclaimed his innocence until his dying breath.

00:11:45.020 --> 00:11:46.910 line:0%
All he wanted was to clear his name

00:11:46.940 --> 00:11:48.200 line:0%
and uncover the truth.

00:11:48.700 --> 00:11:50.680 line:0%
However, you were blinded by hatred

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:52.880 line:0%
and used by others to kill the innocent.

00:11:53.240 --> 00:11:54.160 line:0%
How is this any different

00:11:54.160 --> 00:11:55.240 line:0%
from those who

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:57.170 line:0%
harmed Jinxiu Workshop back then?

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:00.600 line:0%
Now the evidence is conclusive,

00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:03.030 line:0%
and you still dare to spread rumors here!

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:08.710 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen.

00:12:09.130 --> 00:12:10.330 line:0%
Don't you want to know

00:12:11.360 --> 00:12:13.420 line:0%
how Chen Huo'e came back from the dead

00:12:13.810 --> 00:12:15.800 line:0%
and tell me the other culprits involved

00:12:15.800 --> 00:12:18.120 line:0%
in the Jinxiu Workshop case?

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:25.830 line:0%
The real culprit is...

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:30.270 line:0%
Princess Ying!

00:12:30.340 --> 00:12:31.520 line:0%
It's Princess Ying.

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:32.680 line:0%
She's jealous of talent

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:34.440 line:0%
and has long harbored dissatisfied with Princess Runing.

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:35.520 line:0%
So she used Jinxiu Workshop

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:36.960 line:0%
to frame her for treason.

00:12:36.960 --> 00:12:38.080 line:0%
Shut your mouth!

00:12:38.080 --> 00:12:39.200 line:0%
It's not just Princess Ying!

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:40.680 line:0%
Prince Xian is also involved!

00:12:40.680 --> 00:12:42.600 line:0%
He's also unwilling to remain inferior to Princess Ying.

00:12:42.600 --> 00:12:43.880 line:0%
To seize power and authority,

00:12:43.880 --> 00:12:45.240 line:0%
he eliminated his opponents!

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:46.040 line:0%
And there's also...

00:12:46.040 --> 00:12:47.240 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager!

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:48.560 line:0%
They are all murderers!

00:12:48.560 --> 00:12:49.960 line:0%
You, all of you!

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:52.340 line:0%
Every one of you is a murderer!

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:56.160 line:0%
You're falsely accusing the royal family

00:12:56.160 --> 00:12:58.200 line:0%
and slandering the Grand Empress Dowager

00:12:58.200 --> 00:12:59.990 line:0%
just to cause a commotion

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:02.840 line:0%
and get us to reopen the Jinxiu Workshop case.

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:04.280 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen.

00:13:04.320 --> 00:13:06.780 line:0%
This is a serious matter. A serious matter indeed.

00:13:06.780 --> 00:13:08.560 line:0%
Reopening old cases would implicate many.

00:13:08.560 --> 00:13:10.520 line:0%
Please don't bring trouble upon yourself.

00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:11.840 line:0%
As for the ravings of this madman,

00:13:11.840 --> 00:13:12.720 line:0%
let's pretend we didn't hear them.

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:13.850 line:0%
We didn't hear them.

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:14.860 line:0%
Wu Taiming,

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:16.090 line:0%
you corrupt official!

00:13:16.090 --> 00:13:17.730 line:0%
I, Ji Fangming, am not crazy.

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:20.860 line:0%
I, Ji Fangming,

00:13:21.270 --> 00:13:22.730 line:0%
am very clear-headed now.

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:26.030 line:0%
Every word comes from the bottom of my heart.

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:28.370 line:0%
I wonder if Grand Commander Shen

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:30.770 line:0%
dares to report what I've said,

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:33.060 line:0%
word for word,

00:13:33.460 --> 00:13:36.210 line:0%
to the Grand Empress Dowager?

00:13:44.620 --> 00:13:46.110 line:0%
You just can't wait

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:47.710 line:0%
to die, can you?

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:52.640 line:0%
If my life

00:13:54.240 --> 00:13:55.800 line:0%
can appease the spirits of those

00:13:55.800 --> 00:13:57.000 line:0%
who have passed,

00:13:59.890 --> 00:14:00.890 line:0%
it'll be worth it.

00:14:04.460 --> 00:14:05.650 line:0%
If that's the case,

00:14:07.230 --> 00:14:08.820 line:0%
I'll grant your wish.

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:12.750 line:0%
I will report what happened today

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:14.120 line:0%
truthfully to

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:15.650 line:0%
the Grand Empress Dowager.

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:19.210 line:0%
Lord Lai.

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:20.750 line:0%
What do you think?

00:14:22.030 --> 00:14:23.930 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen, you're the presiding judge here.

00:14:23.930 --> 00:14:25.350 line:0%
On behalf of the Imperial Investigation Department,

00:14:25.350 --> 00:14:26.440 line:0%
I'm merely here to observe

00:14:26.440 --> 00:14:28.120 line:0%
the murder case of Mrs. Chen.

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:30.400 line:0%
As for how the Imperial Security Bureau decides,

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:32.200 line:0%
it's up to you, Grand Commander.

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:36.320 line:0%
One is indifferent,

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:38.210 line:0%
and the other is cunning and sly.

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:40.550 line:0%
They both try to keep their hands clean.

00:14:40.550 --> 00:14:41.740 line:0%
I, Ji Fangming,

00:14:42.070 --> 00:14:44.770 line:0%
on behalf of the wrongfully killed people from Jinxiu Workshop,

00:14:44.770 --> 00:14:46.780 line:0%
thank you, Lord Shen.

00:15:02.120 --> 00:15:03.520 line:0%
I've certainly gained some insight

00:15:03.520 --> 00:15:04.720 line:0%
into your intelligence and courage

00:15:04.720 --> 00:15:06.380 line:0%
today, Miss Yan.

00:15:07.320 --> 00:15:08.600 line:0%
I wonder if you'd be interested

00:15:08.600 --> 00:15:10.720 line:0%
in coming to work with me at the Imperial Investigation Department.

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:12.960 line:0%
I'm in need of

00:15:12.960 --> 00:15:14.360 line:0%
capable people like you.

00:15:19.880 --> 00:15:21.000 line:0%
Lord Wu.

00:15:21.360 --> 00:15:22.750 line:0%
I believe you wouldn't be so petty

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:25.010 line:0%
as to hold onto talent so tightly, right?

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:27.550 line:0%
Lord Lai, you must be joking.

00:15:27.720 --> 00:15:28.520 line:0%
Although Yan Xing

00:15:28.520 --> 00:15:30.600 line:0%
is part of the Ministry of Justice,

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:32.060 line:0%
she is, more importantly,

00:15:32.270 --> 00:15:35.520 line:0%
the wife of the Grand Commander of the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:15:35.520 --> 00:15:36.550 line:0%
Lord Lai.

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:38.430 line:0%
You don't plan to

00:15:38.850 --> 00:15:41.450 line:0%
take my person away right in front of me, do you?

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:45.670 line:0%
Grand Commander, given what you said,

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:46.600 line:0%
it seems I'm

00:15:46.600 --> 00:15:48.280 line:0%
hasty and inconsiderate.

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:49.320 line:0%
I simply wanted

00:15:49.320 --> 00:15:51.560 line:0%
to recruit some talent under my wing.

00:15:51.770 --> 00:15:53.400 line:0%
Grand Commander, you're overthinking it.

00:15:53.400 --> 00:15:54.260 line:0%
Overthinking?

00:15:54.690 --> 00:15:55.840 line:0%
After all these years,

00:15:55.840 --> 00:15:56.520 line:0%
Lord Lai,

00:15:56.520 --> 00:15:57.720 line:0%
your ability to turn the tables

00:15:57.720 --> 00:15:59.400 line:0%
hasn't changed one bit.

00:16:02.210 --> 00:16:03.740 line:0%
In matters of officialdom,

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:05.800 line:0%
family affairs shouldn't get involved in the first place.

00:16:05.800 --> 00:16:08.200 line:0%
Given your way of doing things, Grand Commander Shen,

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:09.040 line:0%
I'm afraid Miss Yan

00:16:09.040 --> 00:16:11.130 line:0%
won't have an easy time of it,

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:13.320 line:0%
spending all day solving cases with you.

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:14.360 line:0%
Moreover,

00:16:14.400 --> 00:16:15.810 line:0%
a good bird chooses the tree upon which to perch.

00:16:15.810 --> 00:16:17.470 line:0%
In terms of talent selection,

00:16:17.600 --> 00:16:19.600 line:0%
with such a promising future ahead,

00:16:19.600 --> 00:16:22.560 line:0%
Grand Commander, you shouldn't stand in her way.

00:16:34.630 --> 00:16:36.160 line:0%
I'm quite content,

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:37.460 line:0%
perching on this tree.

00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:39.270 line:0%
You know,

00:16:39.320 --> 00:16:40.600 line:0%
I'm lazy and love to eat.

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:43.260 line:0%
I don't really want to change jobs at the moment.

00:16:45.160 --> 00:16:46.580 line:0%
Thank you for your kind offer,

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:47.660 line:0%
Lord Lai.

00:16:50.330 --> 00:16:51.470 line:0%
If that's the case,

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:53.750 line:0%
let's wait and see

00:16:54.680 --> 00:16:56.480 line:0%
how good this tree you've chosen

00:16:56.900 --> 00:16:58.260 line:0%
can be.

00:17:10.909 --> 00:17:12.220 line:0%
They say,

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:15.409 line:0%
"Husband and wife are like birds of the same forest,

00:17:15.409 --> 00:17:17.810 line:0%
but they fly apart when disaster strikes."

00:17:18.389 --> 00:17:19.240 line:0%
Lord Wu.

00:17:19.669 --> 00:17:21.270 line:0%
What's your opinion on that?

00:17:22.200 --> 00:17:23.280 line:0%
Well,

00:17:23.720 --> 00:17:25.020 line:0%
I'm not very clever.

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:27.110 line:0%
When it comes to matters of love,

00:17:27.490 --> 00:17:28.820 line:0%
I can't figure them out.

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:29.930 line:0%
I really can't.

00:17:30.590 --> 00:17:32.430 line:0%
"Matters of love", you say.

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:34.510 line:0%
Interesting.

00:17:43.580 --> 00:17:46.130 line:0%
"This is a serious matter. A serious matter indeed.

00:17:46.130 --> 00:17:48.000 line:0%
Reopening old cases would implicate many.

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:50.460 line:0%
Please don't bring trouble upon yourself."

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:52.940 line:0%
"As for how the Imperial Security Bureau decides,

00:17:52.940 --> 00:17:55.240 line:0%
it's up to you, Grand Commander."

00:18:05.360 --> 00:18:06.720 line:0%
What are you thinking about?

00:18:06.720 --> 00:18:08.120 line:0%
You seem lost in thought.

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:15.910 line:0%
I'm so tired.

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:17.700 line:0%
I need to go and get some rest.

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:32.200 line:0%
Is something wrong?

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:35.120 line:0%
It seems Yun Que

00:18:35.140 --> 00:18:38.200 line:0%
is particularly concerned about this interrogation.

00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:42.730 line:0%
The old case of Jinxiu Workshop.

00:18:42.730 --> 00:18:44.990 line:0%
She came here for this in the first place.

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:46.280 line:0%
Now,

00:18:46.760 --> 00:18:48.820 line:0%
she finally can't hold back anymore.

00:18:50.840 --> 00:18:51.810 line:0%
So,

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:53.680 line:0%
you deliberately kept her in the mansion

00:18:53.680 --> 00:18:54.800 line:0%
just to find out

00:18:54.800 --> 00:18:57.160 line:0%
whether her appearance was a coincidence,

00:18:57.160 --> 00:18:58.080 line:0%
or if someone was behind it,

00:18:58.080 --> 00:18:59.100 line:0%
pushing things along?

00:18:59.100 --> 00:19:00.830 line:0%
Jing Lin has investigated her.

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:01.840 line:0%
She doesn't know much

00:19:01.840 --> 00:19:03.300 line:0%
about this matter indeed.

00:19:04.480 --> 00:19:05.280 line:0%
However...

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:06.440 line:0%
However what?

00:19:06.560 --> 00:19:07.760 line:0%
However, her parents

00:19:07.840 --> 00:19:09.320 line:0%
had quite a lot of business dealings

00:19:09.320 --> 00:19:11.120 line:0%
with Jinxiu Workshop back then,

00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:15.110 line:0%
but they weren't implicated.

00:19:16.120 --> 00:19:17.080 line:0%
If it was for self-preservation

00:19:17.080 --> 00:19:18.440 line:0%
that they hid the evidence,

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:19.120 line:0%
then why,

00:19:19.120 --> 00:19:20.720 line:0%
after Chen Huo'e appeared,

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:23.290 line:0%
did they steal the evidence and come to seek justice?

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:25.600 line:0%
Don't you think it was too much of a coincidence?

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:26.920 line:0%
If that's the case,

00:19:26.920 --> 00:19:27.520 line:0%
why don't you

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:28.960 line:0%
ask them to clarify?

00:19:30.550 --> 00:19:31.760 line:0%
The time isn't right,

00:19:32.850 --> 00:19:35.050 line:0%
and trying to keep them alive to testify

00:19:35.120 --> 00:19:36.920 line:0%
might not be an easy task either.

00:19:38.520 --> 00:19:39.720 line:0%
We're out in the open,

00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:41.920 line:0%
while others are in the shadows.

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:43.840 line:0%
Please let me

00:19:43.860 --> 00:19:45.300 line:0%
handle this.

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:46.960 line:0%
It's just that

00:19:46.980 --> 00:19:49.450 line:0%
the old case of Jinxiu Workshop involves many people.

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:51.200 line:0%
Even Wu Taiming and Lai Luozhi

00:19:51.200 --> 00:19:52.680 line:0%
are eager to distance themselves from it.

00:19:52.680 --> 00:19:54.200 line:0%
It seems the truth of the matter

00:19:54.200 --> 00:19:55.930 line:0%
is far beyond my expectations,

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:57.940 line:0%
and things might get even deeper.

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:00.330 line:0%
I didn't expect

00:20:00.680 --> 00:20:02.640 line:0%
that the fearless Yan Xing

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:04.520 line:0%
would also have moments of fear.

00:20:08.800 --> 00:20:10.040 line:0%
Are you really

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:11.080 line:0%
going to report

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:12.840 line:0%
Ji Fangming's unorthodox words

00:20:12.840 --> 00:20:14.080 line:0%
as well?

00:20:15.350 --> 00:20:17.000 line:0%
For the Jinxiu Workshop case,

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:18.350 line:0%
I promised someone

00:20:18.600 --> 00:20:20.330 line:0%
to investigate it personally.

00:20:20.560 --> 00:20:21.480 line:0%
Someone?

00:20:25.110 --> 00:20:27.490 line:0%
Could it be Princess Runing?

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:33.260 line:0%
The ignorant are fearless,

00:20:33.440 --> 00:20:35.480 line:0%
while those who know are deeply afraid.

00:20:35.480 --> 00:20:36.920 line:0%
I finally understand

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:38.720 line:0%
the difference between you and me.

00:20:38.720 --> 00:20:40.680 line:0%
You've long anticipated this day,

00:20:40.680 --> 00:20:42.640 line:0%
yet you remain so calm.

00:20:42.640 --> 00:20:43.560 line:0%
All of this doesn't sound like

00:20:43.560 --> 00:20:44.980 line:0%
what you usually say.

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:46.240 line:0%
If it were you normally,

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:47.540 line:0%
upon hearing about a wrongful case,

00:20:47.540 --> 00:20:49.260 line:0%
you would have jumped up to investigate immediately.

00:20:49.260 --> 00:20:50.830 line:0%
No one could have stopped you.

00:20:50.830 --> 00:20:52.060 line:0%
Of course.

00:20:52.280 --> 00:20:53.440 line:0%
We must right every wrong

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:54.520 line:0%
and speak out against injustice.

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:55.960 line:0%
That's what it means to be a good government official,

00:20:55.960 --> 00:20:57.960 line:0%
worthy of the court's salary.

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:01.890 line:0%
But

00:21:02.610 --> 00:21:03.840 line:0%
I know

00:21:03.960 --> 00:21:05.800 line:0%
what it means to

00:21:05.840 --> 00:21:07.100 line:0%
reopen the Jinxiu Workshop case.

00:21:07.100 --> 00:21:09.230 line:0%
Just based on Ji Fangming's few words,

00:21:09.540 --> 00:21:10.340 line:0%
I'm afraid...

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:14.750 line:0%
You've improved.

00:21:24.360 --> 00:21:25.600 line:0%
That wrongful conviction from back then

00:21:25.600 --> 00:21:26.920 line:0%
caused quite a sensation,

00:21:26.920 --> 00:21:27.960 line:0%
leaving many people

00:21:27.960 --> 00:21:29.240 line:0%
with lingering fears.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:31.480 line:0%
Reopening the old case now

00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:33.000 line:0%
will inevitably bring back

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:34.060 line:0%
those old shadows.

00:21:34.200 --> 00:21:34.960 line:0%
When that happens,

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:36.320 line:0%
no one will be able to avoid it.

00:21:36.320 --> 00:21:37.120 line:0%
That's right.

00:21:38.080 --> 00:21:39.440 line:0%
They intend to use Ji Fangming

00:21:39.440 --> 00:21:40.720 line:0%
to bring people's attention to

00:21:40.720 --> 00:21:42.520 line:0%
the old case of Jinxiu Workshop,

00:21:42.560 --> 00:21:44.200 line:0%
so as to make people suspicious of the royal family

00:21:44.200 --> 00:21:45.560 line:0%
and cause unrest.

00:21:46.400 --> 00:21:47.280 line:0%
In the end, Ji Fangming

00:21:47.280 --> 00:21:48.600 line:0%
must have realized

00:21:48.620 --> 00:21:50.020 line:0%
that he was being used,

00:21:50.960 --> 00:21:52.200 line:0%
but he had no choice.

00:21:52.600 --> 00:21:53.600 line:0%
It's pitiful.

00:21:55.960 --> 00:21:56.800 line:0%
And tragic.

00:21:56.620 --> 00:22:01.550 line:0%
[Peace and Prosperity]

00:21:58.650 --> 00:22:00.490 line:0%
How confident are you

00:22:00.690 --> 00:22:02.490 line:0%
about the Jinxiu Workshop case?

00:22:04.650 --> 00:22:06.520 line:0%
That's why I'm worried.

00:22:06.560 --> 00:22:07.640 line:0%
This case is years old.

00:22:07.640 --> 00:22:09.480 line:0%
If you bring it up to the Grand Empress Dowager abruptly,

00:22:09.480 --> 00:22:10.040 line:0%
first, the Grand Empress Dowager

00:22:10.040 --> 00:22:11.320 line:0%
might disagree with reopening the case.

00:22:11.320 --> 00:22:12.640 line:0%
And second, what if she takes her anger out on you?

00:22:12.640 --> 00:22:13.360 line:0%
What should we...

00:22:12.990 --> 00:22:13.780 line:0%
[Peace and Prosperity]

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:18.730 line:0%
So after leaving the Ministry of Justice,

00:22:18.810 --> 00:22:20.540 line:0%
you've been worried all the way

00:22:20.810 --> 00:22:22.230 line:0%
about me?

00:22:29.250 --> 00:22:31.160 line:0%
I'm not worried about you at all.

00:22:31.200 --> 00:22:32.840 line:0%
I'm just worried you may get me involved.

00:22:32.560 --> 00:22:40.730 line:0%
[Peace and Prosperity]

00:22:32.840 --> 00:22:33.810 line:0%
After all,

00:22:33.840 --> 00:22:34.880 line:0%
I now have

00:22:34.880 --> 00:22:36.080 line:0%
the identity of Mrs. Shen

00:22:36.080 --> 00:22:37.040 line:0%
to uphold.

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:38.400 line:0%
Besides, there are all these people

00:22:38.400 --> 00:22:39.320 line:0%
in this household

00:22:39.320 --> 00:22:41.050 line:0%
that I have to consider, right?

00:22:41.640 --> 00:22:43.640 line:0%
Everyone's position is difficult.

00:22:43.850 --> 00:22:46.300 line:0%
The wronged want to reopen old cases,

00:22:46.600 --> 00:22:48.180 line:0%
while what the Grand Empress Dowager wants

00:22:48.180 --> 00:22:49.660 line:0%
is just peace in the realm

00:22:49.820 --> 00:22:51.480 line:0%
and happiness for the people.

00:22:52.510 --> 00:22:53.970 line:0%
So what are you going to do?

00:22:54.270 --> 00:22:55.470 line:0%
Don't worry about me.

00:22:56.680 --> 00:22:57.740 line:0%
As for this matter,

00:22:58.640 --> 00:23:00.500 line:0%
your husband is here to handle it.

00:23:01.100 --> 00:23:03.560 line:0%
I've already said I'm not worried about you.

00:23:17.240 --> 00:23:19.240 line:0%
Then, I'll leave this matter at home

00:23:19.490 --> 00:23:21.040 line:0%
to you, Honey.

00:23:21.840 --> 00:23:23.870 line:0%
Since you know she's trouble,

00:23:24.180 --> 00:23:26.300 line:0%
why do you still keep her in the mansion?

00:23:26.300 --> 00:23:27.260 line:0%
She might

00:23:28.480 --> 00:23:30.720 line:0%
still have important evidence on her.

00:23:31.770 --> 00:23:33.760 line:0%
Is this your explanation?

00:23:34.170 --> 00:23:37.010 line:0%
You're truly cold and heartless, White Ghost,

00:23:37.030 --> 00:23:39.030 line:0%
always causing trouble for others.

00:23:48.620 --> 00:23:49.360 line:0%
Well,

00:23:49.360 --> 00:23:50.080 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:23:51.250 --> 00:23:53.080 line:0%
Continue to keep an eye on Yun Que.

00:23:53.080 --> 00:23:54.400 line:0%
If there's a chance,

00:23:54.420 --> 00:23:55.180 line:0%
see if

00:23:55.210 --> 00:23:56.640 line:0%
she's still hiding anything

00:23:56.640 --> 00:23:58.200 line:0%
on the Jinxiu Workshop case.

00:23:58.200 --> 00:23:58.840 line:0%
Got it.

00:24:09.230 --> 00:24:10.930 line:0%
[Guangyue Restaurant]

00:24:28.910 --> 00:24:30.460 line:0%
Kidnap someone for me.

00:24:33.010 --> 00:24:34.590 line:0%
I don't mean for you to actually kidnap them.

00:24:34.590 --> 00:24:36.050 line:0%
I just need you, Pan,

00:24:36.080 --> 00:24:37.060 line:0%
to go to Jiangnan in person

00:24:37.060 --> 00:24:39.390 line:0%
and bring that person safely to Xiang'an.

00:24:41.510 --> 00:24:42.310 line:0%
Jiangnan?

00:24:44.230 --> 00:24:45.650 line:0%
I remember that Yun Que in the Shen household,

00:24:45.650 --> 00:24:48.250 line:0%
who competed with you for the position of legitimate wife,

00:24:48.250 --> 00:24:50.110 line:0%
is also from Jiangnan, isn't she?

00:24:51.960 --> 00:24:53.200 line:0%
Could it be you're jealous of her,

00:24:53.200 --> 00:24:54.130 line:0%
so you want to...

00:24:54.320 --> 00:24:55.120 line:0%
Please.

00:24:56.280 --> 00:24:57.680 line:0%
Great talent Pan.

00:24:57.700 --> 00:24:59.220 line:0%
Pan. Pan Chi.

00:24:59.410 --> 00:25:01.870 line:0%
You're the only one who can help me with this.

00:25:02.320 --> 00:25:04.000 line:0%
I beg you, please.

00:25:05.560 --> 00:25:07.010 line:0%
It's not really a big deal.

00:25:07.010 --> 00:25:08.110 line:0%
It's just

00:25:08.240 --> 00:25:09.560 line:0%
a bit of legwork, though.

00:25:09.560 --> 00:25:10.580 line:0%
Don't you worry about that.

00:25:10.580 --> 00:25:11.770 line:0%
When you come back,

00:25:11.800 --> 00:25:14.240 line:0%
I'll definitely treat you to a grand feast

00:25:14.280 --> 00:25:16.840 line:0%
and some top-quality wine.

00:25:16.860 --> 00:25:18.700 line:0%
Besides, I can tell

00:25:18.720 --> 00:25:20.510 line:0%
you're not just an ordinary merchant.

00:25:20.510 --> 00:25:22.120 line:0%
I definitely won't expose you

00:25:22.120 --> 00:25:23.180 line:0%
and cause trouble.

00:25:25.340 --> 00:25:26.690 line:0%
Are you threatening me?

00:25:27.340 --> 00:25:28.510 line:0%
Of course not.

00:25:28.650 --> 00:25:30.160 line:0%
How could I?

00:25:30.400 --> 00:25:31.550 line:0%
After all, we're

00:25:31.760 --> 00:25:33.620 line:0%
friends who help each other.

00:25:34.400 --> 00:25:35.540 line:0%
Just friends, huh?

00:25:35.710 --> 00:25:36.860 line:0%
What's that?

00:25:37.280 --> 00:25:38.080 line:0%
Nothing.

00:25:38.210 --> 00:25:40.530 line:0%
I'll be waiting for your treat then.

00:25:42.420 --> 00:25:43.220 line:0%
Oh, by the way.

00:25:43.520 --> 00:25:44.120 line:0%
Take this

00:25:44.240 --> 00:25:44.880 line:0%
with you.

00:25:45.000 --> 00:25:46.260 line:0%
It's right on your way.

00:25:48.480 --> 00:25:49.280 line:0%
What's this?

00:25:49.360 --> 00:25:51.080 line:0%
This is the list of victims

00:25:51.080 --> 00:25:52.680 line:0%
Chen Huo'e killed back then.

00:25:53.590 --> 00:25:54.750 line:0%
You...

00:25:55.040 --> 00:25:56.760 line:0%
For these crossed-out names,

00:25:56.840 --> 00:25:58.680 line:0%
their crime scenes are all near Xiang'an City

00:25:57.940 --> 00:25:59.490 line:0%
[Lyu Ruozhi, Zhao Caiwei, Song Zhilan]

00:25:58.680 --> 00:25:59.720 line:0%
or not far away.

00:25:59.720 --> 00:26:01.750 line:0%
You'll pass by a few of them on your trip.

00:26:01.750 --> 00:26:03.560 line:0%
Just investigate a bit

00:26:03.560 --> 00:26:05.360 line:0%
about the victims' situations.

00:26:07.480 --> 00:26:09.130 line:0%
Trying to get a free meal from you

00:26:09.130 --> 00:26:10.570 line:0%
is really not easy.

00:26:12.680 --> 00:26:13.480 line:0%
Oh, right.

00:26:13.760 --> 00:26:14.560 line:0%
This thingy.

00:26:14.640 --> 00:26:15.440 line:0%
You take it.

00:26:15.490 --> 00:26:16.570 line:0%
I just acquired it.

00:26:17.210 --> 00:26:19.030 line:0%
Why are you giving me a fan?

00:26:19.240 --> 00:26:20.640 line:0%
Is there some trick to it?

00:26:20.920 --> 00:26:22.040 line:0%
Be careful with it.

00:26:22.490 --> 00:26:23.690 line:0%
It has a mechanism.

00:26:24.760 --> 00:26:26.800 line:0%
The handle is hollow.

00:26:26.830 --> 00:26:28.530 line:0%
You can put powder inside.

00:26:28.580 --> 00:26:29.910 line:0%
With just a light flick,

00:26:29.960 --> 00:26:31.480 line:0%
you can secretly

00:26:31.480 --> 00:26:32.680 line:0%
scatter the powder.

00:26:32.700 --> 00:26:35.000 line:0%
The handle is hollow.

00:26:35.790 --> 00:26:37.290 line:0%
So this is for poisoning?

00:26:37.940 --> 00:26:39.140 line:0%
Well, not exactly.

00:26:39.340 --> 00:26:40.960 line:0%
The so-called secret weapons

00:26:40.960 --> 00:26:42.320 line:0%
depend on who uses them

00:26:42.360 --> 00:26:43.560 line:0%
and how they're used.

00:26:45.650 --> 00:26:48.360 line:0%
You're giving me such a rare item.

00:26:49.120 --> 00:26:51.500 line:0%
You're not...

00:26:53.640 --> 00:26:54.640 line:0%
You're not...

00:26:56.430 --> 00:26:59.160 line:0%
You're not planning to force me to buy it, are you?

00:26:59.410 --> 00:27:00.360 line:0%
Well, you keep it for now.

00:27:00.360 --> 00:27:01.300 line:0%
If you find it useful,

00:27:01.300 --> 00:27:02.430 line:0%
you can pay me later.

00:27:03.360 --> 00:27:05.290 line:0%
Isn't that still forcing me to buy it?

00:27:05.290 --> 00:27:06.740 line:0%
Is there poison inside?

00:27:07.240 --> 00:27:08.470 line:0%
It won't kill a person,

00:27:08.470 --> 00:27:10.570 line:0%
but it can easily

00:27:10.640 --> 00:27:12.110 line:0%
knock out a bull.

00:27:14.200 --> 00:27:15.320 line:0%
Have you all heard?

00:27:15.720 --> 00:27:17.320 line:0%
The ruins of Jinxiu Workshop

00:27:17.320 --> 00:27:18.240 line:0%
have shown another miracle.

00:27:18.240 --> 00:27:18.880 line:0%
Really?

00:27:18.880 --> 00:27:20.800 line:0%
Swarms of moths flocked to the wall,

00:27:20.800 --> 00:27:22.140 line:0%
and the blood from the moths' corpses formed words.

00:27:22.140 --> 00:27:23.160 line:0%
Even flying insects are

00:27:23.160 --> 00:27:25.280 line:0%
crying out for justice for the old case of Jinxiu Workshop.

00:27:25.280 --> 00:27:26.200 line:0%
The reborn Huo'e...

00:27:26.200 --> 00:27:26.800 line:0%
How bizarre.

00:27:26.800 --> 00:27:28.860 line:0%
Is about to seek revenge on the real culprit!

00:27:28.860 --> 00:27:29.800 line:0%
The Jinxiu Workshop incident

00:27:29.800 --> 00:27:31.440 line:0%
happened so many years ago.

00:27:31.680 --> 00:27:33.280 line:0%
Why is something like this suddenly happening now?

00:27:33.280 --> 00:27:34.600 line:0%
Haven't you heard?

00:27:34.720 --> 00:27:36.360 line:0%
More people have been beheaded

00:27:36.360 --> 00:27:37.400 line:0%
because of the Jinxiu Workshop incident.

00:27:37.400 --> 00:27:39.660 line:0%
This has caused unrest among the people.

00:27:40.720 --> 00:27:42.520 line:0%
This case must have been a miscarriage of justice.

00:27:42.520 --> 00:27:44.120 line:0%
Too many people died tragically back then

00:27:44.120 --> 00:27:45.200 line:0%
and they couldn't get justice.

00:27:45.200 --> 00:27:46.720 line:0%
That must be why they linger in this world.

00:27:46.720 --> 00:27:47.400 line:0%
These wronged souls,

00:27:47.400 --> 00:27:49.630 line:0%
they won't just randomly seek revenge on anyone, will they?

00:27:49.630 --> 00:27:51.460 line:0%
We're all innocent, you know.

00:27:51.600 --> 00:27:52.280 line:0%
I heard

00:27:52.280 --> 00:27:53.720 line:0%
only by reopening this case

00:27:53.720 --> 00:27:54.800 line:0%
and bringing justice to the deceased

00:27:54.800 --> 00:27:55.680 line:0%
can these wronged souls

00:27:55.680 --> 00:27:57.270 line:0%
rest in peace.

00:27:57.330 --> 00:28:00.800 line:0%
[Cautiousness and Leniency]

00:28:05.310 --> 00:28:06.850 line:0%
Why aren't you eating?

00:28:09.630 --> 00:28:12.360 line:0%
If you don't eat soon, the noodles will get soggy.

00:28:13.250 --> 00:28:14.450 line:0%
You came back so late.

00:28:14.920 --> 00:28:16.640 line:0%
You must have eaten out, haven't you?

00:28:16.640 --> 00:28:17.440 line:0%
Of course.

00:28:17.800 --> 00:28:18.800 line:0%
No matter how tired or exhausted I am,

00:28:18.800 --> 00:28:20.540 line:0%
I can't let myself starve.

00:28:23.800 --> 00:28:24.880 line:0%
These past few days,

00:28:24.880 --> 00:28:26.520 line:0%
I've done so many things.

00:28:26.520 --> 00:28:27.720 line:0%
It's worn me out.

00:28:31.000 --> 00:28:31.800 line:0%
Come on, eat.

00:28:35.640 --> 00:28:36.970 line:0%
You know what?

00:28:37.130 --> 00:28:39.880 line:0%
I went to investigate Jinxiu Workshop at night.

00:28:40.000 --> 00:28:42.600 line:0%
As expected, I saw what looked like ghost fires

00:28:42.600 --> 00:28:44.150 line:0%
floating in the air.

00:28:44.280 --> 00:28:47.040 line:0%
There was always something floating around,

00:28:47.120 --> 00:28:49.110 line:0%
but I couldn't see it clearly.

00:28:49.240 --> 00:28:50.200 line:0%
This must be

00:28:50.200 --> 00:28:52.460 line:0%
the ghost shadows that the common people

00:28:52.760 --> 00:28:54.160 line:0%
have been talking about.

00:28:54.240 --> 00:28:55.400 line:0%
On my way back,

00:28:55.400 --> 00:28:56.040 line:0%
I saw

00:28:56.040 --> 00:28:57.480 line:0%
that every household on the street

00:28:57.480 --> 00:28:59.200 line:0%
next to Jinxiu Workshop

00:28:59.280 --> 00:29:01.600 line:0%
had hung this

00:29:02.200 --> 00:29:04.000 line:0%
Fire Moth Jade at their doorway.

00:29:12.360 --> 00:29:14.090 line:0%
Investigating alone at night,

00:29:14.640 --> 00:29:16.040 line:0%
don't you find it creepy?

00:29:16.520 --> 00:29:18.080 line:0%
Those are all fake.

00:29:18.420 --> 00:29:20.640 line:0%
I suppose

00:29:20.850 --> 00:29:22.560 line:0%
it must be the resurrected

00:29:22.560 --> 00:29:24.040 line:0%
Chen Huo'e's doing.

00:29:25.360 --> 00:29:26.880 line:0%
But as for ghost fires,

00:29:26.920 --> 00:29:27.720 line:0%
I see them quite often

00:29:27.720 --> 00:29:29.480 line:0%
in graveyards during summer.

00:29:29.670 --> 00:29:31.380 line:0%
My master once told me

00:29:31.430 --> 00:29:33.680 line:0%
that it's because when corpses decompose,

00:29:33.680 --> 00:29:34.520 line:0%
they produce some kind of

00:29:34.520 --> 00:29:36.070 line:0%
imperceptible substance,

00:29:36.320 --> 00:29:37.400 line:0%
which gets ignited

00:29:37.400 --> 00:29:38.720 line:0%
in the dry air.

00:29:38.880 --> 00:29:40.480 line:0%
The method for ghost shadows

00:29:40.680 --> 00:29:41.960 line:0%
should be similar, I guess.

00:29:41.960 --> 00:29:43.440 line:0%
It's just the shadow of

00:29:43.440 --> 00:29:45.370 line:0%
a fast-moving black bird or beast.

00:29:46.880 --> 00:29:48.090 line:0%
As expected,

00:29:49.240 --> 00:29:50.520 line:0%
you know everything.

00:29:50.520 --> 00:29:52.180 line:0%
Are you doing this on purpose?

00:29:55.050 --> 00:29:56.880 line:0%
The area where Jinxiu Workshop is located

00:29:56.880 --> 00:29:57.720 line:0%
should have been

00:29:57.720 --> 00:30:00.000 line:0%
guarded by the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:01.400 line:0%
But this afternoon,

00:30:01.400 --> 00:30:03.240 line:0%
when the moths swarmed on the wall,

00:30:03.240 --> 00:30:05.040 line:0%
causing the so-called miracle,

00:30:05.120 --> 00:30:07.040 line:0%
the guards didn't disperse the crowd.

00:30:07.040 --> 00:30:08.520 line:0%
Jing Lin was clearly around,

00:30:08.520 --> 00:30:10.200 line:0%
but he just watched from afar.

00:30:11.360 --> 00:30:12.160 line:0%
So?

00:30:13.110 --> 00:30:15.260 line:0%
The Imperial Security Bureau has many things to investigate.

00:30:15.260 --> 00:30:17.400 line:0%
Ji Fangming has already been arrested.

00:30:17.400 --> 00:30:19.750 line:0%
There's no need to bother with those things.

00:30:19.750 --> 00:30:21.950 line:0%
Aren't you waiting?

00:30:25.900 --> 00:30:26.910 line:0%
Waiting for what?

00:30:28.200 --> 00:30:29.660 line:0%
Waiting for a gust

00:30:30.750 --> 00:30:32.880 line:0%
that could help reopen

00:30:32.880 --> 00:30:34.710 line:0%
the Jinxiu Workshop case.

00:30:48.700 --> 00:30:49.820 line:0%
You went out for a bit

00:30:49.820 --> 00:30:51.680 line:0%
and brought something back, huh?

00:30:53.040 --> 00:30:54.080 line:0%
Be careful.

00:30:55.120 --> 00:30:56.180 line:0%
Don't mess with it.

00:30:56.570 --> 00:30:57.770 line:0%
Don't mess with it...

00:30:57.960 --> 00:30:58.820 line:0%
Why so nervous?

00:30:59.920 --> 00:31:00.920 line:0%
Who gave it to you?

00:31:01.770 --> 00:31:03.000 line:0%
I haven't paid

00:31:03.000 --> 00:31:03.520 line:0%
for this fan yet.

00:31:03.520 --> 00:31:04.760 line:0%
Don't break it.

00:31:06.040 --> 00:31:06.840 line:0%
Is that so?

00:31:26.920 --> 00:31:28.250 line:0%
What's with you lately?

00:31:29.150 --> 00:31:30.880 line:0%
You've been acting so strange.

00:31:34.160 --> 00:31:34.960 line:0%
Have I?

00:31:35.560 --> 00:31:36.360 line:0%
Yes, you have.

00:31:41.520 --> 00:31:42.440 line:0%
In the future, if I

00:31:42.440 --> 00:31:43.960 line:0%
don't have time to make the medicated diet,

00:31:43.960 --> 00:31:45.080 line:0%
you must eat on time

00:31:45.080 --> 00:31:46.480 line:0%
and not starve yourself.

00:31:47.520 --> 00:31:48.320 line:0%
Also,

00:31:49.200 --> 00:31:50.360 line:0%
don't suddenly say

00:31:50.360 --> 00:31:51.880 line:0%
some nonsensical things,

00:31:51.920 --> 00:31:52.800 line:0%
and then put on

00:31:52.800 --> 00:31:54.130 line:0%
some frightening pose.

00:31:54.320 --> 00:31:55.920 line:0%
Also, don't suddenly...

00:32:02.070 --> 00:32:03.030 line:0%
Suddenly what?

00:32:06.740 --> 00:32:08.430 line:0%
Just suddenly...

00:32:18.080 --> 00:32:19.400 line:0%
Don't waste food.

00:32:25.040 --> 00:32:25.840 line:0%
Alright.

00:32:29.040 --> 00:32:31.300 line:0%
If you don't allow it, I'll listen to you.

00:32:32.720 --> 00:32:33.760 line:0%
But from now on,

00:32:33.920 --> 00:32:34.880 line:0%
don't do such dangerous things

00:32:34.880 --> 00:32:36.360 line:0%
like investigating Jinxiu Workshop at night

00:32:36.360 --> 00:32:37.440 line:0%
again.

00:32:38.380 --> 00:32:39.760 line:0%
Fortunately, there were people I arranged

00:32:39.760 --> 00:32:41.160 line:0%
guarding there tonight.

00:32:41.240 --> 00:32:42.040 line:0%
Otherwise...

00:32:42.760 --> 00:32:44.970 line:0%
You really don't take your life seriously.

00:32:44.970 --> 00:32:46.430 line:0%
I'll only allow this once.

00:32:46.930 --> 00:32:48.390 line:0%
Don't let it happen again.

00:32:58.740 --> 00:33:00.080 line:0%
What's happening?

00:33:00.690 --> 00:33:01.790 line:0%
My head is so dizzy.

00:33:03.990 --> 00:33:05.000 line:0%
No way.

00:33:05.490 --> 00:33:06.560 line:0%
Pan Chi.

00:33:07.400 --> 00:33:09.960 line:0%
You've really got me in trouble this time.

00:33:11.960 --> 00:33:12.520 line:0%
Yan Xing?

00:33:13.360 --> 00:33:16.820 line:0%
Knock Out A Bull...

00:33:18.080 --> 00:33:18.950 line:0%
This...

00:33:53.190 --> 00:33:57.590 line:0%
♫The night is still young, and the moonlight reflects on the west window♫

00:33:58.540 --> 00:34:01.650 line:0%
♫There are stars in your eyes♫

00:33:58.630 --> 00:33:59.990 line:0%
It smells so good.

00:34:02.140 --> 00:34:03.720 line:0%
♫When I touch you♫

00:34:04.540 --> 00:34:07.730 line:0%
♫My heart is like a flickering candlelight, shaking and swaying♫

00:34:08.959 --> 00:34:13.390 line:0%
♫The more I care, the deeper I hide♫

00:34:14.510 --> 00:34:19.030 line:0%
♫Leaves turn yellow and fall, and my thoughts run in thousands of lines♫

00:34:18.999 --> 00:34:20.910 line:0%
You're taking all the advantages.

00:34:19.850 --> 00:34:22.990 line:0%
♫Time is like a poem, romantic and sorrowful♫

00:34:23.479 --> 00:34:25.240 line:0%
♫Two hearts♫

00:34:26.039 --> 00:34:29.160 line:0%
♫Collide between dawn and dusk♫

00:34:29.820 --> 00:34:33.930 line:0%
♫The embrace came as a surprise♫

00:34:35.300 --> 00:34:37.870 line:0%
♫I want to be with you, side by side♫

00:34:38.370 --> 00:34:41.590 line:0%
♫I want to keep you by my side♫

00:34:42.240 --> 00:34:45.650 line:0%
♫Through the obstacle of wind and rain♫

00:34:46.150 --> 00:34:48.600 line:0%
♫I want to be your moonlight♫

00:34:49.019 --> 00:34:52.459 line:0%
♫Accompany you until every dawn♫

00:34:52.900 --> 00:34:54.939 line:0%
♫How I wish♫

00:34:55.650 --> 00:34:58.780 line:0%
♫I could just forget the passage of time like this♫

00:34:59.600 --> 00:35:02.280 line:0%
♫I want to be with you, side by side♫

00:35:02.630 --> 00:35:06.010 line:0%
♫May we never forget each other♫

00:35:06.810 --> 00:35:09.930 line:0%
♫There will always be a place for us to meet♫

00:35:10.430 --> 00:35:13.070 line:0%
♫I want to be with you forever♫

00:35:13.630 --> 00:35:16.780 line:0%
♫When our black hair turns grey♫

