00:37:37.440 --> 00:37:38.840 line:0%
Let Madam sleep as much as she wants.

00:37:38.840 --> 00:37:40.040 line:0%
No need to wake her up.

00:37:40.800 --> 00:37:41.600 line:0%
Understood.

00:37:46.760 --> 00:37:48.760 line:0%
What a character, this Ji Fangming.

00:37:49.560 --> 00:37:51.190 line:0%
Showing no courtesy of being an official

00:37:51.190 --> 00:37:52.920 line:0%
is already a great disrespect.

00:37:53.720 --> 00:37:54.840 line:0%
He even dared

00:37:54.860 --> 00:37:57.280 line:0%
to use the old case of Jinxiu Workshop

00:37:57.600 --> 00:38:00.880 line:0%
to slander and frame Prince Xian and Princess Ying.

00:38:01.440 --> 00:38:03.840 line:0%
He truly deserves to die a thousand deaths.

00:38:05.160 --> 00:38:06.320 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:38:06.560 --> 00:38:07.560 line:0%
Ji Fangming has committed numerous evil deeds.

00:38:07.560 --> 00:38:08.480 line:0%
His death would be no loss.

00:38:08.480 --> 00:38:09.520 line:0%
However, behind this case,

00:38:09.520 --> 00:38:11.000 line:0%
there's someone else instigating

00:38:11.000 --> 00:38:12.440 line:0%
and using Ji Fangming's obsession

00:38:12.440 --> 00:38:13.480 line:0%
to spread terror.

00:38:15.900 --> 00:38:17.240 line:0%
Who is that?

00:38:18.440 --> 00:38:19.520 line:0%
It is none other than

00:38:19.520 --> 00:38:20.520 line:0%
the serial killer who was arrested

00:38:20.520 --> 00:38:22.050 line:0%
and committed suicide five years ago,

00:38:22.050 --> 00:38:22.850 line:0%
Chen Huo'e.

00:38:23.310 --> 00:38:24.110 line:0%
What?

00:38:24.760 --> 00:38:26.160 line:0%
A dead person

00:38:27.280 --> 00:38:28.600 line:0%
could still cause such a stir

00:38:28.600 --> 00:38:30.120 line:0%
in Xiang'an City?

00:38:32.560 --> 00:38:33.840 line:0%
I remember

00:38:34.360 --> 00:38:35.560 line:0%
that this case

00:38:35.800 --> 00:38:39.060 line:0%
was personally investigated by you back then, Lai Luozhi.

00:38:40.880 --> 00:38:42.960 line:0%
What exactly is this about?

00:38:43.650 --> 00:38:45.040 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:38:45.200 --> 00:38:46.400 line:0%
The case of Chen Huo'e back then

00:38:46.400 --> 00:38:47.790 line:0%
caused widespread panic.

00:38:47.790 --> 00:38:48.480 line:0%
Therefore,

00:38:48.480 --> 00:38:49.840 line:0%
after I captured Chen Huo'e,

00:38:49.840 --> 00:38:51.600 line:0%
I executed her publicly.

00:38:51.600 --> 00:38:52.360 line:0%
At that time,

00:38:52.400 --> 00:38:54.330 line:0%
half of Xiang'an City's residents

00:38:54.360 --> 00:38:55.440 line:0%
witnessed Chen Huo'e

00:38:55.440 --> 00:38:56.900 line:0%
commit suicide in public.

00:38:57.000 --> 00:38:58.360 line:0%
In front of everyone,

00:38:58.400 --> 00:39:00.730 line:0%
her corpse was thrown into the mass grave.

00:39:01.040 --> 00:39:01.840 line:0%
It's just...

00:39:02.160 --> 00:39:03.240 line:0%
It's just what?

00:39:03.480 --> 00:39:05.680 line:0%
It's just Chen Huo'e publicly declared

00:39:06.160 --> 00:39:08.690 line:0%
the mad words that she would come back to life.

00:39:11.360 --> 00:39:12.920 line:0%
So you mean,

00:39:13.160 --> 00:39:15.280 line:0%
she has really come back to life?

00:39:15.400 --> 00:39:16.200 line:0%
Recently,

00:39:16.590 --> 00:39:17.760 line:0%
there have indeed been rumors

00:39:17.760 --> 00:39:18.990 line:0%
of Chen Huo'e's appearance.

00:39:18.990 --> 00:39:20.480 line:0%
There's even a group of followers

00:39:20.480 --> 00:39:21.760 line:0%
who believe that person is the same Chen Huo'e

00:39:21.760 --> 00:39:23.520 line:0%
who was arrested and committed suicide five years ago.

00:39:23.520 --> 00:39:24.600 line:0%
However, I believe

00:39:25.080 --> 00:39:26.080 line:0%
it's just someone with ulterior motives

00:39:26.080 --> 00:39:27.120 line:0%
causing trouble

00:39:27.600 --> 00:39:28.930 line:0%
and misleading people.

00:39:31.480 --> 00:39:32.580 line:0%
My dear ministers.

00:39:32.720 --> 00:39:34.850 line:0%
Chen Huo'e's fabrication of miracles

00:39:35.120 --> 00:39:36.560 line:0%
has caused the people to suspect

00:39:36.560 --> 00:39:39.200 line:0%
that there was injustice concerning the old Jinxiu Workshop case.

00:39:39.200 --> 00:39:41.280 line:0%
The Imperial Security Bureau has reported

00:39:41.280 --> 00:39:42.160 line:0%
and applied for the reinvestigation

00:39:42.160 --> 00:39:44.800 line:0%
of the two old cases of

00:39:44.920 --> 00:39:47.050 line:0%
Chen Huo'e and Jinxiu Workshop as one.

00:39:47.200 --> 00:39:49.480 line:0%
What are your opinions on this?

00:39:49.640 --> 00:39:52.080 line:0%
You love the people like your own children, Your Majesty.

00:39:52.080 --> 00:39:53.520 line:0%
Now that Grand Commander Shen

00:39:53.520 --> 00:39:55.720 line:0%
intends to reopen this case,

00:39:55.920 --> 00:39:57.920 line:0%
I find it quite appropriate.

00:39:58.680 --> 00:39:59.520 line:0%
Mr. Lai.

00:39:59.520 --> 00:40:01.400 line:0%
Do you have any special insights?

00:40:04.760 --> 00:40:06.040 line:0%
In my humble opinion,

00:40:06.360 --> 00:40:08.860 line:0%
the sudden resurfacing of the old case of Jinxiu Workshop

00:40:08.860 --> 00:40:10.590 line:0%
may have hidden implications.

00:40:10.880 --> 00:40:11.760 line:0%
However,

00:40:11.840 --> 00:40:13.040 line:0%
whether this old case will disturb

00:40:13.040 --> 00:40:14.570 line:0%
the peace of Xiang'an City,

00:40:15.160 --> 00:40:16.720 line:0%
I dare not speculate.

00:40:17.400 --> 00:40:18.280 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:40:18.480 --> 00:40:20.420 line:0%
I have just retrieved the previous case files,

00:40:20.420 --> 00:40:21.840 line:0%
and upon careful examination, I discovered

00:40:21.840 --> 00:40:23.520 line:0%
there are still some unresolved questions.

00:40:23.520 --> 00:40:25.240 line:0%
You've always been attentive to the people's concerns

00:40:25.240 --> 00:40:26.460 line:0%
and compassionate towards their lives, Your Majesty.

00:40:26.460 --> 00:40:27.720 line:0%
I understand this matter is troublesome,

00:40:27.720 --> 00:40:30.250 line:0%
but I dare not withhold the truth in my report.

00:40:33.590 --> 00:40:34.640 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:40:34.640 --> 00:40:35.560 line:0%
I believe

00:40:35.560 --> 00:40:36.920 line:0%
Commander Shen's words are quite reasonable.

00:40:36.920 --> 00:40:38.420 line:0%
If we can investigate this matter thoroughly,

00:40:38.420 --> 00:40:40.840 line:0%
it will bring peace and comfort to the people,

00:40:40.840 --> 00:40:42.740 line:0%
which is surely what you desire, Mother.

00:40:42.740 --> 00:40:44.320 line:0%
This action will also

00:40:44.320 --> 00:40:46.120 line:0%
demonstrate your heart for relieving the people's hardships and concerns

00:40:46.120 --> 00:40:48.080 line:0%
to all the people.

00:40:48.200 --> 00:40:51.060 line:0%
What a fine idea, relieving the people's concerns.

00:40:51.060 --> 00:40:52.200 line:0%
Mr. Shen.

00:40:52.440 --> 00:40:53.720 line:0%
I hereby entrust this case

00:40:53.720 --> 00:40:55.320 line:0%
entirely to you.

00:40:55.580 --> 00:40:58.300 line:0%
You must investigate it thoroughly.

00:40:58.480 --> 00:40:59.600 line:0%
I accept the command.

00:40:59.600 --> 00:41:01.340 line:0%
I won't disappoint your expectations, Your Majesty.

00:41:01.340 --> 00:41:04.070 line:0%
I will apprehend the culprit as soon as possible.

00:41:06.380 --> 00:41:07.800 line:0%
What's your opinion on Grand Commander Shen's decision

00:41:07.800 --> 00:41:09.960 line:0%
to reopen this case?

00:41:10.880 --> 00:41:12.080 line:0%
The incident from back then

00:41:12.080 --> 00:41:13.540 line:0%
caused widespread panic.

00:41:20.480 --> 00:41:22.210 line:0%
I take my leave, Your Highness.

00:41:28.200 --> 00:41:29.120 line:0%
Your Highness.

00:41:29.160 --> 00:41:31.960 line:0%
You've never interfered much with state affairs.

00:41:32.120 --> 00:41:32.880 line:0%
This time, it seems

00:41:32.880 --> 00:41:34.480 line:0%
you've drawn attention to yourself.

00:41:34.480 --> 00:41:35.280 line:0%
Mentor.

00:41:35.920 --> 00:41:37.780 line:0%
I didn't think too much this time.

00:41:38.080 --> 00:41:39.520 line:0%
I just wanted to see how Shen Du

00:41:39.520 --> 00:41:41.450 line:0%
would handle this investigation.

00:41:43.360 --> 00:41:45.160 line:0%
Back then, when Princess Runing

00:41:45.200 --> 00:41:47.580 line:0%
was implicated in the Jinxiu Workshop case,

00:41:47.580 --> 00:41:49.210 line:0%
there were suspicions

00:41:49.320 --> 00:41:50.640 line:0%
that it was the doing of Princess Ying,

00:41:50.640 --> 00:41:51.700 line:0%
who was at odds with Princess Runing.

00:41:51.700 --> 00:41:53.300 line:0%
If the reopening of this case

00:41:53.370 --> 00:41:54.560 line:0%
can reveal the truth

00:41:54.560 --> 00:41:56.040 line:0%
and implicate Princess Ying,

00:41:56.040 --> 00:41:56.880 line:0%
it would be

00:41:56.880 --> 00:41:58.080 line:0%
great news for us.

00:41:58.080 --> 00:41:59.480 line:0%
We could use their hands

00:41:59.480 --> 00:42:01.810 line:0%
to eliminate your rivals, Your Highness.

00:42:02.320 --> 00:42:03.800 line:0%
Mentor, you're overthinking it.

00:42:03.800 --> 00:42:04.800 line:0%
I simply want to uncover

00:42:04.800 --> 00:42:06.200 line:0%
the truth of what happened back then, that's all.